{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"10205","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10205","key":"MC-3697","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"22/Nov/12 7:39 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>TNT submerged in water can destroy item frames, paintings, armor stands, and other similar entities.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build the setup as shown in the attachment below.&nbsp;<span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10378\" title=\"setup.png attached to MC-3697\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"setup.png\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"51aa907e-5650-45e6-9fec-bb87cd94dea9\" rel=\"noreferrer\">setup.png<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span></li>\n\t<li>Ignite the TNT and wait for it to explode.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not TNT submerged in water can destroy item frames, paintings, armor stands, and other similar entities.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>TNT can destroy item frames, paintings, armor stands, and other similar entities.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>TNT would not be able to destroy item frames, paintings, armor stands, and other similar entities.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"02/May/15 1:43 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/10373","